{"title": "Vengeful", "pageid": 28161, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vengeful", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Vengeful</b> is a passive feature that grants an extra <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> and a special reaction attack to retaliate against melee attackers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Creature gains an extra reaction. When attacked, the creature can use a reaction to counterattack with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Strike\" title=\"Vengeful Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vengeful Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Strike\" title=\"Vengeful Strike\">Vengeful Strike</a>, dealing weapon damage and <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Strike\" title=\"Vengeful Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vengeful Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Vengeful_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Strike\" title=\"Vengeful Strike\">Vengeful Strike</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Vengeance_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Vengeance (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Mask of Vengeance (Overgrown Tunnel)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Vengeance_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Vengeance (The Blushing Mermaid)\">Mask of Vengeance (The Blushing Mermaid)</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715120545\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1213/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8264/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3443/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 364/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1051444/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.079      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   38.079      1 -total\n 34.94%   13.306      1 Template:PageSeo\n 34.13%   12.995      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 21.32%    8.119      1 Template:R\n 17.95%    6.834      3 Template:Icon_link\n 16.74%    6.375      3 Template:Icon_text\n 13.98%    5.322      1 Template:SmSAI\n 12.98%    4.941     11 Template:Trim\n  8.81%    3.353      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28161-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715120545 and r